      "text": "[9:44PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement on Oba Akran Road, Kodesoh Road, Local Airport Road, Oba Akinjobi Way, and Ikeja GRA.\n\nMobolaji Bank Anthony Way inward Maryland, exhibiting fluid movement.\n\nEfficient vehicular flow from Anthony to Maryland Intersection, en route to Odo'yalaro, with both inward and outward journeys proceeding with ease.\n\nUnimpeded traffic on Oba Akran Link Bridge and Airport Link Bridge, facilitating smooth passage.\n\nOfficers are strategically on ground, actively managing traffic to maintain a seamless flow of vehicles.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
