      "text": "[10:46PM] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth traffic movement on Eko Bridge by NEPA Intersection inward Apongbon.\nDescending Eko Bridge inward to CMS Bridge, connecting to CMS is better.\nDescending Eko Bridge inward Elegbeta Mini Stadium, Ebute-Ero Market, and connecting to Eko Bridge is good.\nDescending from Carter Bridge inward Ebute-Ero Market, Leventis, through UBA Roundabout, and connecting to Inner and Outer Marina is good.\n\nGood traffic flow on Broad Street stretch to Apongbon underneath the bridge, connecting to Offin Canal Market and Olowogbowo.\nCMS Bridge inward Offin Canal Market stretch, extending to Ijora Olopa by NEPA Intersection is also good. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
